        {
            "id": 6673586,
            "title": "盤中速報 - 聯友金屬-創(7610)股價殺至跌停，跌停價774.0元，成交620張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>聯友金屬-創(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:7610:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/7610\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">7610-TW</a>)27日11:12下跌86元，股價跌停報774.0元，委賣25張，成交620張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為鎢酸鈉與硫酸鈷。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>聯友金屬-創(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:7610:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/7610\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">7610-TW</a>)近5日股價上漲6.83%，集中市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>上漲1.89%，股價漲幅表現優於大盤。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：-33 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：-60 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：0 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：+27 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
